ATTRIBUTION

The on-controller stick recalibration protocol (NVS unlock/calibrate/flash over
HID) was reverse-engineered by Paolo "the_al" and the dualshock-tools project
(https://github.com/dualshock-tools/dualshock-tools.github.io, MIT). This
project re-implements that protocol independently with its own diagnostics,
trigger, and MCP layers. Full credit to that work.

DISCLAIMER: This software communicates with controller hardware and can write
to the controller's non-volatile memory. Use at your own risk. The authors are
not responsible for any damage to your controller.
